        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-6626, 12\" Fullerton Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fullerton 12 Inch Door Pull features a traditional design that is great for use in a wide array of home decors. Choose from 7 beautiful finishes, including satin nickel, black, and oil rubbed bronze. Just click on the picture to the right to see them all. RK International's PH-6626 Fullerton Pull has a classic style and is easy to install. This handle comes packaged with all the necessary hardware for a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/traditional-fullerton-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-126\"><b>Matching Fullerton Cabinet Knob</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/fullerton-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-626\"><b>Matching Fullerton Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 12\" Traditional Fullerton Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fullerton 12 Inch Door Pull",
                "description": "RK International PH-6626, Fullerton 12 Inch Door Pull - The Fullerton 12 Inch Door Pull features a traditional design that is great for use in a wide array of home decors. Choose from 7 beautiful finishes, including satin nickel, black, and oil rubbed bronze. Just click on the picture to the right to see them all. RK International's PH-6626 Fullerton Pull has a classic style and is easy to install. This handle comes packaged with all the necessary hardware. \r\n",
